 DirSelectCenterButtons;myGuiParms;info;parms
⍝ Allows the user to select a directory.
 myGuiParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 info←'Where would you like to install the software?'
 parms←##.APLGUI.DirSelect.CreateParms
 parms.addToCaption←'Directory'
 parms.alignButtons←##.APLGUI.Enums.Align.Center
 ⎕←parms myGuiParms ##.APLGUI.DirSelect.Run'C:\Windows\System32'
⍝Done
